{
  "id": "dmw7we2hio9dk",
  "name": "筛选面板",
  "tags": [
    "展开",
    "筛选"
  ],
  "summary": "按钮只显示筛选描述，点开是完整筛选面板；点空白不收起，必须点取消或确定。",
  "usage": "列表/表格的复杂筛选：多个维度（状态、类型、时间）组合，用户需要反复调整后再一次性生效。",
  "caution": "单维度、两三个选项时直接用「下拉选择面板」；筛选值超过 6 组改用侧边抽屉；每次点击都即时生效的筛选不需要确定按钮。",
  "hint": "点开筛选，改完点确定生效",
  "prompt": "【筛选面板】目标：一个「筛选」按钮，点开后弹出一块筛选面板（多维度的单选/多选），**点空白处不收起**，必须点「取消」或「确定」才关闭；确定后按钮上显示已选条件数。\n\n1) 结构：.trigger（按钮：筛选图标 + 文案 + 已选数量徽标 + chevron）+ .panel（绝对定位在按钮下方，宽约 240px）。面板内 = 若干 .group（label + 选项胶囊）+ .foot（取消/确定）。\n\n2) 交互：点 trigger toggle；面板内点选项只改选中态（不关闭）；**点页面空白不关闭**——这是它和普通下拉最大的区别，因为复杂筛选需要用户慢慢勾选，误触外部就收起会很烦。\n\n3) 选项：单选组用「一排胶囊」互斥（点新的取消旧的）；多选组用同款胶囊但可以多个同时亮。选中态 = 品牌色淡底 + 品牌色文字 + 品牌色边框。\n\n4) 底部：取消（次要按钮，收起并丢弃本次改动）/ 确定（品牌色主按钮，收起并应用，同时更新 trigger 上的数量徽标）。\n\n5) 演示里为了简单，取消只收起不改状态；真实项目要保存一份「打开时的快照」用于还原。\n\n6) 无障碍：trigger 加 aria-haspopup + aria-expanded；面板 role=\"dialog\"（不是 menu，因为它有表单性质）；选项用 aria-pressed。\n\n7) 坑：面板要在 trigger 下方绝对定位且不能超出视口；点面板内部要 stopPropagation，否则会被当成「点外部」；选项多时要能滚动（max-height + overflow）。\n\n8) 配色：选中态品牌色；确定按钮品牌色 + 文字 var(--ui-bg)。\n\n9) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环（点按钮 → 面板展开 → 点「进行中」→ 点「开发」→ 点确定 → 显示已选 2 项）；弹窗里只绑真实点击。\n\n10) 使用场景：多维度组合筛选；单维度用下拉选择；选项过多用抽屉。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:18px}\n\n.wrap{position:relative}\n\n.trigger{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:9px;\n  border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface);color:var(--ui-text);\n  font:inherit;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;\n  transition:border-color .15s ease,background .15s ease}\n.trigger:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 45%,var(--ui-border))}\n.trigger svg{width:12px;height:12px;flex:0 0 auto}\n.trigger .chev{color:var(--ui-text-dim);transition:transform .2s ease}\n.wrap.open .trigger{border-color:var(--ui-brand);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 7%,var(--ui-surface))}\n.wrap.open .trigger .chev{transform:rotate(180deg)}\n.badge{min-width:15px;height:15px;padding:0 4px;border-radius:999px;display:grid;place-items:center;\n  background:var(--ui-brand);color:var(--ui-bg);font-size:9px;font-weight:700}\n.badge.z{display:none}\n\n/* 面板以按钮中心为轴向两侧展开，避免右侧出框 */\n.panel{position:absolute;left:50%;top:calc(100% + 8px);width:238px;margin-left:-119px;border-radius:12px;\n  background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  box-shadow:0 18px 44px color-mix(in srgb,#000 18%,transparent);\n  padding:11px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\n  opacity:0;transform:translateY(-4px);pointer-events:none;\n  transition:opacity .16s ease,transform .18s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)}\n.wrap.open .panel{opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto}\n\n.group{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}\n.group label{font-size:10px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.opts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px}\n.opt{appearance:none;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text-dim);\n  font:inherit;font-size:10px;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer;\n  transition:background .14s ease,color .14s ease,border-color .14s ease,transform .12s ease}\n.opt:hover{color:var(--ui-text)}\n.opt:active{transform:scale(.94)}\n.opt.on{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 12%,transparent);color:var(--ui-brand);\n  border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 40%,var(--ui-border))}\n\n.foot{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:2px}\n.foot button{flex:1;font:inherit;font-size:10px;padding:6px;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer}\n.foot .cancel{border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.foot .ok{border:0;background:var(--ui-brand);color:var(--ui-bg);font-weight:600}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:10px;align-items:flex-start}\n  .wrap{margin-top:6px}\n  .trigger{font-size:10px;padding:5px 10px}\n  .panel{width:220px;margin-left:-110px;padding:8px;gap:6px}\n  .group{gap:4px}\n  .group label{font-size:9px}\n  .opts{gap:4px}\n  .opt{font-size:9px;padding:3px 8px}\n  .foot{margin-top:0}\n  .foot button{font-size:9px;padding:5px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .trigger,.panel,.opt,.chev{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\" id=\"wrap\">\n  <button class=\"trigger\" id=\"trigger\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 5h18M6 12h12M10 19h4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n    筛选\n    <span class=\"badge z\" id=\"badge\">0</span>\n    <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 4.6 L6 7.4 L9 4.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n  </button>\n\n  <div class=\"panel\" id=\"panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"筛选\">\n    <div class=\"group\">\n      <label>状态</label>\n      <div class=\"opts\" data-group=\"status\" data-mode=\"single\">\n        <button class=\"opt on\" data-v=\"all\">全部</button>\n        <button class=\"opt\" data-v=\"doing\">进行中</button>\n        <button class=\"opt\" data-v=\"done\">已完成</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"group\">\n      <label>类型</label>\n      <div class=\"opts\" data-group=\"type\" data-mode=\"multi\">\n        <button class=\"opt\" data-v=\"design\">设计</button>\n        <button class=\"opt\" data-v=\"dev\">开发</button>\n        <button class=\"opt\" data-v=\"ops\">运营</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\">\n      <button class=\"cancel\" id=\"cancel\">取消</button>\n      <button class=\"ok\" id=\"ok\">确定</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var wrap = document.getElementById('wrap'),\n      trigger = document.getElementById('trigger'),\n      panel = document.getElementById('panel'),\n      badge = document.getElementById('badge'),\n      ok = document.getElementById('ok'),\n      cancel = document.getElementById('cancel');\n\n  var open = false;\n  var timer = null, cursor = null;\n\n  function setOpen(on){\n    open = on;\n    wrap.classList.toggle('open', on);\n    trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', on ? 'true' : 'false');\n  }\n\n  function updateBadge(){\n    var n = panel.querySelectorAll('.opt.on[data-v]:not([data-v=\"all\"])').length;\n    badge.textContent = String(n);\n    badge.classList.toggle('z', n === 0);\n  }\n\n  trigger.addEventListener('click', function(){ setOpen(!open); });\n  panel.addEventListener('click', function(e){ e.stopPropagation(); });\n\n  var groups = [].slice.call(panel.querySelectorAll('.opts'));\n  groups.forEach(function(g){\n    var mode = g.getAttribute('data-mode');\n    g.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n      var opt = e.target.closest('.opt');\n      if(!opt) return;\n      if(mode === 'single'){\n        [].slice.call(g.querySelectorAll('.opt')).forEach(function(o){ o.classList.remove('on'); });\n        opt.classList.add('on');\n      } else {\n        opt.classList.toggle('on');\n      }\n    });\n  });\n\n  function apply(){ updateBadge(); setOpen(false); }\n  ok.addEventListener('click', apply);\n  cancel.addEventListener('click', function(){ setOpen(false); });\n\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key === 'Escape') setOpen(false); });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function tap(c, el, cb){\n    c.moveTo(el);\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      setTimeout(function(){ c.release(); cb(); }, 170);\n    }, 420);\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    setOpen(false);\n    updateBadge();\n\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c || !c.el) return;\n\n    c.el.classList.add('show');\n\n    var doing = panel.querySelector('[data-v=\"doing\"]');\n    var dev = panel.querySelector('[data-v=\"dev\"]');\n\n    tap(c, trigger, function(){\n      setOpen(true);\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        tap(c, doing, function(){\n          doing.classList.add('on');\n          setTimeout(function(){\n            tap(c, dev, function(){\n              dev.classList.add('on');\n              setTimeout(function(){\n                tap(c, ok, function(){\n                  apply();\n                  if(c.hide) c.hide();\n                });\n              }, 500);\n            });\n          }, 500);\n        });\n      }, 600);\n    });\n  }\n\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 5200); }, 400);\n  }\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
